==Police officers involved==
The investigations were carried out by officers from the Financial Crimes Branch of the Istanbul Police Department.

According to public prosecutor Celal Kara, who was involved in the 17 December investigation, the officers who carried out the operation included branch head [[Yakub Saygılı]], deputy branch heads Kazım Aksoy and Yasin Topçu, bureau chief Mehmet Akif Üner, and police officers [[Hüseyin Korkmaz]] and Savaş Akyol.

The 25 December investigation was also carried out by personnel from the same branch. Saygılı, Aksoy, Topçu and Mahir Çakallı were among the senior police officials involved in the investigation. Other officers later prosecuted in connection with the 25 December case included Arif İbiş, Mustafa Demirhan, Mehmet Habip Kunt, İbrahim Şener, Mehmet Fatih Yiğit and Mehmet Akif Üner.

Following the operations, several officers involved were dismissed from their posts, detained or prosecuted in connection with the investigations. In 2018, the Istanbul 13th High Criminal Court convicted Saygılı, Aksoy, Topçu, Çakallı, İbiş, Demirhan, Kunt, Şener, Yiğit and Üner in the 25 December case. The verdicts were subsequently reviewed in appellate proceedings and by the Court of Cassation.<ref>{{Cite web |last=Merkezi |first=Haber |date=2015-01-26 |title=Savcı Celal Kara 17 Aralık'ı anlattı |url=https://www.sozcu.com.tr/canonicalUrl |access-date=2026-09-28 |website=www.sozcu.com.tr |language=tr}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=DHA |date=2018-12-24 |title=(geniş haber) 25 ARALIK KUMPAS DAVASI'NDA KARAR AÇIKLANDI |url=https://t24.com.tr/gundem/genis-haber-25-aralik-kumpas-davasinda-karar-aciklandi,781054 |access-date=2026-09-28 |website=T24 |language=Turkish}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Kocaaslan |first=Nur Banu |date=2016-01-06 |title=25 Aralık soruşturmasında görevli polislerin yargılanması başladı - Diken |url=https://www.diken.com.tr/25-aralik-sorusturmasinda-gorevli-polislerin-yargilanmasi-basladi/ |access-date=2026-09-28 |language=tr}}</ref>
